  "content_text": "一切以盘面为主,\n我交易十几年，经历的大小消息数不胜数，疫情、俄乌、关税等等。\n消息改变不了行情本身的趋势，它只有两点作用:\n1.是行情的催化剂，会加快速度但无法改变方向。\n2.可能会影响开盘价或者短线。\n而被影响的开盘价和短线走势一旦与本身趋势相反，过一段时间就会被修复。\n我们不是要去解读消息本身，而是观察两点：\n1.在消息发生后，大盘是否被消息“错误”的影响，走出了和本身趋势相反的“错误”走势？\n这是方向上的套利机会。\n2.因为消息加快了行情的波动，是否有品种快速打到了关键支撑或阻力位？\n这是时间上的捕捉机会。\n观点不变，3月仍然先以红利为主。\n刘广义\nA0630624060004\n投资有风险 入市需谨慎 个人观点 仅供参考\n案例截图\n不做投资依据  上海凯石证券投资咨询有限公司",
  "content_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \"><p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 16px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\"> </span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">一切以盘面为主,</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">我交易十几年，经历的大小消息数不胜数，疫情、俄乌、关税等等。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">       消息改变不了行情本身的趋势，它只有两点作用:</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 2em;line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">1.是行情的催化剂，会加快速度但无法改变方向。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">      2.可能会影响开盘价或者短线。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">      而被影响的开盘价和短线走势一旦与本身趋势相反，过一段时间就会被修复。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">      </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\"> 我们不是要去解读消息本身，而是观察两点：</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">      1.在消息发生后，大盘是否被消息“错误”的影响，走出了和本身趋势相反的“错误”走势？</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">      这是方向上的套利机会。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">      2.因为消息加快了行情的波动，是否有品种快速打到了关键支撑或阻力位？</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: normal;\" textstyle=\"\">      这是时间上的捕捉机会。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" textstyle=\"\">      </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">观点不变，3月仍然先以红利为主。</span></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style='-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0pt;padding: 0pt;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 2em;line-height: 1.6em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;'><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;text-transform: none;font-style: normal;font-size: 9pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin-top: 0px;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0